attempts": 2, "runtime_actions": ["blind_retry_timeout"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-2025-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 40865, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PLcJ7146M4aT8TCzFUwfk3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 42409, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The service now reports healthy with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18 on v2.3.1.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** It is the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 is unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc was only deployed to staging. Because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the failure, the rollback, and the regions affected. It also paged the on-call engineer.\n\nv2.3.1 still needs investigation before anyone re-releases it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01VbnfkAiEA7pipteZWfAMaS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EvPsVLNFSrToZZFmkMS5uW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 (seq 3) is unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. v2.3.0 has been healthy in production, so it doesn't need change-manager approval. Rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01MTEPaxwj4wuyJJ9XrbDTgN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "inpu